  "description": "Where each handwritten functions/src module sits (issue #1350). Contexts reuse the app's vocabulary from context_map.json, in its order, plus backend-only contexts. Platform imports only platform; a domain context imports platform and contexts declared before it; a surface imports platform, any domain context and its own files; only index.ts imports a surface. Target roots win; otherwise the longest legacy path decides (a path ending in / is a folder, any other path one file). Code moved before the scripted move goes under its target root. A generated dispatch registry (dispatchRegistries; issue #2451, tool/architecture/generate_dispatch_registries.mjs) is the one module that may import any context or surface, and only its area entry imports it. knownContextOrderImports and knownCrossContextWrites list today's context-order imports and cross-context writes one by one: the checker fails on any other, and on a listed one that no longer happens.",
